                    <chunk name="param_input" index="7">
                      <items count="8">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Press to query OpenStreetMap (the land cover, then the paved and bare-soil surfaces) AND download the terrain tiles, in the background — the canvas stays live. Responses are cached on disk, so later solves and document opens read them offline. One press is one attempt: a Fetch held true by a wired toggle does not retry a failed download on every recompute — press again, or flip the toggle off and on. Right-click the component to cancel, or to force a refresh.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">d3acb3de-5d55-4b17-a280-d38d67b7a8c7</item>
