              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">8b319084-5c80-42eb-ad63-03d198cf9af9</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Description</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Purpose: Pedestrian-level wind around an Atlanta site for every prevailing wind direction, solved on one mesh.
Fidelity: Engineering - steady RANS, not validated for this site. Cite: Kastner and Dogan (2020), cylindrical mesh.
Method: Steady RANS in OpenFOAM on a cylindrical mesh; Wind Rose Cluster reduces the EPW to up to 8 directions and speeds.
Result: Velocity U probed 1.5 m above terrain, one direction per slider step.
Needs: Eddy3D Setup &gt; (U)RANS CFD (OpenFOAM). Runtime: hours.
Edit: Station, site coordinates, buildings, tree zones; toggle Fetch for land cover and terrain.</item>
                  </items>
